# Country Roads: "This land enters tapped unless you control a Mount or Vehicle" (CR 614.1d): only the permanents its own
# controller controls count. Bot2 casts a Smuggler's Copter (a Vehicle, CR 301.7) on turn 2 with two Moxen; on turn 3 Bot1
# plays Country Roads and it enters tapped, though a Vehicle is on the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Country Roads
Island x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Smuggler's Copter
Island x17

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Smuggler's Copter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Country Roads.Play
? Bot2.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Subtypes = Vehicle
! Bot1.Battlefield.Country Roads.Activate(Ability: Add)

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Country Roads.Tapped = true
